@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "<<class>>\nProcessor" as Processor
participant "<<class>>\nOrderHandlers" as Handlers
participant "state:AppState" as State
participant "history:OrderHistory" as History
participant "order:Order" as Order

[-> Processor : process(...)
activate Processor
note over Processor
    APPROVE is an ANYWHERE
    command: checkLocation
    always passes.
end note
Processor -> Handlers : approve(c, state)
activate Handlers
Handlers -> State : getOrderHistory()
activate State
State --> Handlers : history
deactivate State
Handlers -> History : getOrders()
activate History
History --> Handlers : orders
deactivate History
note over Handlers, History
    requireOrderAtIndex validates the
    order number and selects order 1.
end note

Handlers -> Order : approve()
activate Order
note right of Order
    WAITING_APPROVAL becomes
    WAITING_FOR_DELIVERY.
    Other states are rejected.
end note
Order --> Handlers : return
deactivate Order
note over Handlers, Order
    Stock and the order's item are unchanged.
end note
Handlers --> Processor : success Result
deactivate Handlers
[<-- Processor : success Result
deactivate Processor
@enduml
